{
  "name": "SiteTwin – Gmail → Ablage",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "4fbe664d-4fca-49e2-bf38-4ad27bf2be82",
      "name": "Hier anpassen",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-60, -260],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Hier anpassen\n1. **Gmail: Mail mit Label** – Suchfilter `label:sitetwin` an den Namen deines Gmail-Labels anpassen. „Simplify“ bleibt **aus**, „Download Attachments“ **an**.\n2. **Konfiguration** – `ablage_url` (öffentliche Tunnel-Adresse der Ablage) und `projekt` eintragen. Für Tests `Test Santino` lassen.\n3. Credentials wählen: Gmail (nur im Trigger), Header Auth „Ablage Token“ (in „An Ablage senden“). Kein Google-Zugang im HTTP-Request-Node.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 940,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e1689de3-aa01-4ab4-b98e-47583f2d4034",
      "name": "Gmail: Mail mit Label",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmailTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [0, 0],
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyMinute"
            }
          ]
        },
        "simple": false,
        "maxResults": 10,
        "filters": {
          "q": "label:sitetwin",
          "readStatus": "both"
        },
        "options": {
          "downloadAttachments": true,
          "dataPropertyAttachmentsPrefixName": "attachment_"
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Gmail SiteTwin"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2aa2f2b6-e01f-4b41-aed0-c4fc26e37203",
      "name": "Mail für Ablage aufbereiten",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [240, 0],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "language": "javaScript",
        "jsCode": "// Baut je Mail den Body für POST /import/email/gmail-felder: { mail, anhaenge }.\n// projekt kommt danach aus dem Node „Konfiguration“.\n// Anhänge: n8n Cloud hält Binärdaten außerhalb des Items, deshalb über\n// getBinaryDataBuffer lesen und nicht über binary[key].data.\nconst nummer = (k) => {\n  const m = k.match(/(\\d+)$/);\n  return m ? Number(m[1]) : Number.MAX_SAFE_INTEGER;\n};\nconst ergebnis = [];\nconst items = $input.all();\nfor (let i = 0; i < items.length; i++) {\n  const binaer = items[i].binary || {};\n  const schluessel = Object.keys(binaer).sort((a, b) => nummer(a) - nummer(b) || a.localeCompare(b));\n  const anhaenge = [];\n  for (const key of schluessel) {\n    const puffer = await this.helpers.getBinaryDataBuffer(i, key);\n    anhaenge.push({\n      name: binaer[key].fileName || null,\n      mime: binaer[key].mimeType || null,\n      base64: puffer.toString('base64'),\n    });\n  }\n  ergebnis.push({ json: { mail: items[i].json, anhaenge }, pairedItem: { item: i } });\n}\nreturn ergebnis;\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "06b71fb0-4c8d-42ea-9e6e-89fec7a15df2",
      "name": "Konfiguration",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [480, 0],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "00395705-6cec-4daa-bc81-0efacb2dabf9",
              "name": "ablage_url",
              "value": "https://DEINE-ADRESSE.example",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "84d980a4-faf1-43fe-ad4c-1f61cbd55ee4",
              "name": "projekt",
              "value": "Test Santino",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "7cfdaeba-f172-4787-8c46-cb267c3be314",
      "name": "An Ablage senden",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [720, 0],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Konfiguration').item.json.ablage_url.replace(/\\/+$/, '') }}/import/email/gmail-felder",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ projekt: $json.projekt, mail: $json.mail, anhaenge: $json.anhaenge }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Ablage Token"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
